{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01462",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.57,
      "end_seconds": 3.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Good morning. I've just opened your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.67,
      "end_seconds": 7.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Evening, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.77,
      "end_seconds": 10.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "What's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.61,
      "end_seconds": 19.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.15,
      "text": "I'm here because of night sweats. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.11,
      "end_seconds": 23.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.42,
      "end_seconds": 37.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "So, hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.82,
      "end_seconds": 41.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Yes. Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.4,
      "end_seconds": 45.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "It feels severe to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.39,
      "end_seconds": 49.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Has there been poor sleep too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.92,
      "end_seconds": 59.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.98,
      "text": "Mm, um, yes. Uh, as for poor sleep, pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. And vaginal dryness, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.98,
      "end_seconds": 65.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "How troublesome is it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.3,
      "end_seconds": 70.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.98,
      "end_seconds": 78.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Have you had night sweats before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.78,
      "end_seconds": 85.29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.76,
      "end_seconds": 99.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.28,
      "end_seconds": 104.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Let me think, no, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.32,
      "end_seconds": 118.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.42,
      "end_seconds": 122.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Um, my cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.14,
      "end_seconds": 127.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.4,
      "end_seconds": 138.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "I'm on naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day for the knee pain. I'm on glibenclamide, 5 milligrams, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.4,
      "end_seconds": 144.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.8,
      "end_seconds": 149.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.51,
      "end_seconds": 153.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.9,
      "end_seconds": 162.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "I've had arthritis in my knees for five years now. I told my wife I'd come today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.05,
      "end_seconds": 165.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Right, right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.7,
      "end_seconds": 170.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, I've had diabetes for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.94,
      "end_seconds": 181.12,
      "duration_seconds": 9.18,
      "text": "Okay, I can see arthritis in your knees and diabetes in your file as well. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.67,
      "end_seconds": 184.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.52,
      "end_seconds": 186.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.56,
      "end_seconds": 192.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.9,
      "end_seconds": 195.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.27,
      "end_seconds": 198.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.51,
      "end_seconds": 203.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.21,
      "end_seconds": 207.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.7,
      "end_seconds": 211.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Any sign of heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.34,
      "end_seconds": 214.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Nope, no heavy bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.8,
      "end_seconds": 218.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Any chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.67,
      "end_seconds": 223.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "No, no chest pain or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.49,
      "end_seconds": 226.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Mm, okay. How's your breathing otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.95,
      "end_seconds": 230.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "No, um, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.46,
      "end_seconds": 235.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.79,
      "end_seconds": 238.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.26,
      "end_seconds": 242.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.36,
      "end_seconds": 252.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.25,
      "end_seconds": 288.4,
      "duration_seconds": 14.15,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, weight 55 kilos, temperature 37.0. And blood pressure 125 over 79, BMI works out to 15.9, height 186 centimetres, heart rate 86."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.07,
      "end_seconds": 294.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.96,
      "end_seconds": 298.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.07,
      "end_seconds": 311.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.72,
      "end_seconds": 317.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.48,
      "end_seconds": 339.96,
      "duration_seconds": 9.48,
      "text": "Putting it all together, I think we're dealing with menopausal symptoms at this stage. We shouldn't forget an overactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.66,
      "end_seconds": 343.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.19,
      "end_seconds": 371.89,
      "duration_seconds": 26.7,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like menopausal symptoms, but I'd like to confirm. Let's get a thyroid test, for hot flushes. I'm going to put you on estradiol patch, 50 micrograms, twice weekly, long term. It's for menopausal symptoms. Dress in layers and keep the bedroom cool. If the symptoms get worse, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.89,
      "end_seconds": 376.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.92,
      "end_seconds": 384.46,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "See me again in three months. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.19,
      "end_seconds": 389.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "Thank you, um, that's helpful."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.02,
      "end_seconds": 391.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Right, take care now."
    }
  ]
}